0001CAr 2               
0001CAr 2                 ; Clear the trail ownership planes -- stale ownership bits from a
0001CAr 2                 ; previous round would corrupt this round's majority-color voting (see
0001CAr 2                 ; PixelSetP1Trail/PixelSetP2Trail) from tick one.
0001CAr 2  A9 00          lda #<P1_OWN_BUF
0001CCr 2  85 52          sta WORK_PTR
0001CEr 2  A9 50          lda #>P1_OWN_BUF
