000238r 2  85 55          sta SCAN_TMP
00023Ar 2  E6 55          inc SCAN_TMP
00023Cr 2               @sides:
00023Cr 2                 ; One pixel per row on each side, matching the top/bottom walls' own
00023Cr 2                 ; single-pixel thickness (the previous version filled a full 8-pixel
00023Cr 2                 ; byte column here, making the side walls eight times thicker than the
00023Cr 2                 ; top/bottom ones).
00023Cr 2  A2 08          ldx #ARENA_MIN_X
00023Er 2  A5 55          lda SCAN_TMP
000240r 2  20 rr rr       jsr PixelSetBorder
000243r 2               
000243r 2  A2 F7          ldx #ARENA_MAX_X
000245r 2  A5 55          lda SCAN_TMP
